From 68c95afbfe67dbdf3a0ee78446d3f3373aaee4d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 12:24:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] kaiair: ch.4 true-SINR DL feedback (UE half)

- nr_pdsch_data_rssi (Eq. 4.52/4.53) + nr_measure_interference (Eq. 4.54/4.55)
  in nr_dlsch_demodulation.c: slot-level PDSCH-data RSSI (data REs only) and
  unused-RB interference from post-FFT samples, finalized at last PDSCH symbol
- measurements ride the CSI MEAS_IND (fapi_nr_l1_measurements_t) into MAC
  csirs_measurements
- KAIAIR_CH4_CSI=1: nr_get_csi_payload returns the custom 10-bit payload
  (5-bit qRSSI + 5-bit qI, LSB-first Eq. 4.56, reverse_bits before PUCCH);
  nr_get_csi_bitlen forces 10 so PRB sizing matches the gNB
- quantization q=round((dB-REF)/STEP) clamped [0,31]; REF/STEP env-tunable
  (bench: REF 20, STEP 2, clip-free at observed 44-67 dB levels)
